# 디렉토리 구조

`create-next-app`에 `--src-dir`를 쓰면 아래 트리를 `src/` 아래에 둔다. 새 파일은 이 위치에만 만든다. 트리를 임의로 바꾸지 않는다.

```
app/
  (auth)/
  (main)/
  blog/
    [slug]/
    page.tsx
  api/
    notion/
components/
  common/
    buttons/
    forms/
  layouts/
    MainLayout.tsx
    BlogLayout.tsx
    AuthLayout.tsx
  features/
    blog/
      post-card.tsx
      post-content.tsx
      post-list.tsx
    auth/
  ui/
lib/
  notion/
    client.ts
    queries.ts
    transforms.ts
  utils/
    date.ts
    string.ts
    validation.ts
hooks/
  common/
  features/
    blog/
      use-post.ts
      use-posts.ts
types/
  common/
  notion/
    database.ts
    block.ts
    page.ts
styles/
  globals.css
  markdown.css
public/
  images/
  fonts/
config/
  site.ts
  notion.ts
```
